}_{K},\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a>,\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0218073c8db43619\" href=\"?note=0218073c8db43619\" title=\"89-df-gl-rule\">89-df-gl-rule</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L},\\\\\n\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal A_{G\\!L},\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}proof\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal{T}_{\\Box}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\cup\\mathcal{A}_{L},\\\\\n\\mathcal{P}_{G\\!L}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathcal A_{G\\!L},\\mathcal{R}_{G\\!L}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL包含K的所有公理和规则</li>\n<li>模式 4 可由 K 与 Löb 模式导出，不列为原始公理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis